      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "partOf": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-153"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-153-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal intervals for discrimination based on inherent position requirements overlap with employee's term",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A term of a modern award does not discriminate against an employee:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-153-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "No discrimination allowed",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibition",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A term of a modern award does not discriminate against an employee:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-153-ss-2-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Good faith and avoiding injury to religious susceptibilities are permitted reasons for discrimination",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Permission",
      "cml:premiseText": "(i) in good faith; and (ii) to avoid injury to the religious susceptibilities of adherents of that religion or creed."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-153-ss-2-logic-ltl-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal intervals for discrimination based on religious susceptibilities repeat with each employment as staff member",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Repeats",
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) merely because it discriminates, in relation to employment of the employee as a member of the staff of an institution that is conducted in accordance with the doctrines, tenets, beliefs or teachings of a particular religion or creed:"
