    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.94",
      "skos:note": "Employment relationship characterized by absence of firm advance commitment to continuing and indefinite work is to be assessed based on real substance, practical reality, and true nature.",
      "skos:prefLabel": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "15A(2) Meaning of casual employee"
      },
      "wasDerivedFrom": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf",
      "asserts": [
        "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-norm",
        "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
        "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
        "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-3",
        "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-ltl-4",
        "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-deontic-5",
        "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-6"
      ],
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:integrityHash": "d9f02a9a39c8143cc5b0735fa776e930bb1cee964ad28ce5f120c55b3c64abba",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "realizedBy": "doc:fair-work-act-2009#sec-15a-ss-2",
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "partOf": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Employer's ability to offer or not offer work may indicate presence of firm advance commitment",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Temporal relation",
      "cml:premiseText": "(i) whether there is an inability of the employer to elect to offer, or not offer, work or an inability of the employee to elect to accept or reject work (and whether this occurs in practice);"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Employer has obligation to provide continuing work",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Employee has obligation to accept or reject work",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) on the basis that a firm advance commitment can be in the form of the contract of employment or, in addition to the terms of that contract, in the form of a mutual understanding or expectation between the employer and employee not rising to the level of a term of that contract (or to a variation of any such term);"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Classification of employment relationship based on real substance, practical reality, and true nature",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Classify",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(a), whether the employment relationship is characterised by an absence of a firm advance commitment to continuing and indefinite work is to be assessed:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Classification of mutual understanding or expectation between employer and employee",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Classify",
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) on the basis that a firm advance commitment can be in the form of the contract of employment or, in addition to the terms of that contract, in the form of a mutual understanding or expectation between the employer and employee not rising to the level of a term of that contract (or to a variation of any such term);"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-logic-ltl-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Future availability of continuing work may indicate presence of firm advance commitment",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Recurring trace",
      "cml:premiseText": "(ii) whether, having regard to the nature of the employer’s enterprise, it is reasonably likely that there will be future availability of continuing work in that enterprise of the kind usually performed by the employee;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15a-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "doc:Obligation",
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State",
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
