      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "An enterprise agreement ceases to cover employees after it has ceased to operate.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits enterprise agreements from covering employees after operation ends.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) Despite subsections (1), (2) and (3), an enterprise agreement that has ceased to operate does not cover an employee, employer or employee organisation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-53-ss-5-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The diffusion of an enterprise agreement's coverage ends at the time of its operation cessation.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Enterprise agreements diffuse their coverage to employees upon operation end.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Diffuses",
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) Despite subsections (1), (2) and (3), an enterprise agreement that has ceased to operate does not cover an employee, employer or employee organisation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-53-ss-5-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The termination of an enterprise agreement is recurring at the time of operation cessation.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Enterprise agreements terminate at the time of operation cessation in a recurring manner.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Recurring",
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) Despite subsections (1), (2) and (3), an enterprise agreement that has ceased to operate does not cover an employee, employer or employee organisation."
    },
